{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32197","headline":"唐庄恪太子挽歌词二首 二 · 温庭筠","name":"唐庄恪太子挽歌词二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东府虚容卫，西园寄梦思。\n凤悬吹曲夜，鸡断问安时。\n尘陌都人恨，霜郊賵马悲。\n唯余埋璧地，烟草近丹墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}